          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2f78671e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## The `return` keyword\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d974d9db",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "函数返回的值是最后一个被计算表达式的值，默认情况下也就是函数定义体中最后一个表达式的值。对于上面定义的函数 `f`，这就是表达式 `x + y` 的值。或者，`return` 关键字会使函数立即结束，并返回所给表达式的值。\n\n例如：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7b44b79d",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function g(x,y)\r\n    return x * y\r\n    x + y\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7ace39a7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Let’s call the function `g` with arguments $$ and $2 xml-ph-0000@deepl.内部 3$:\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a69a440f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "g(2,3)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1132da77",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "As we can see, the function `g` ran the operation of multiplying the arguments $$ and $2 xml-ph-0000@deepl.内部 3$, i.e. the operation written immediately after the `return` keyword, whilst the next operation (the addition of the arguments `x` and `y`) was ignored.\n\nOf course, in the linear body of a function (such as `g`), using `return` is pointless. Since the expression `x + y` is never evaluated, we could simply make `x * y` the last expression in the function and omit `return`. However, in the case of a different control flow, `return` can indeed be useful.\n\nHere, for example, is the function `quadratic`, which calculates the roots of the quadratic equation $ax²+bx+c=0$. The arguments of the function are the coefficients `a`, `b` and `c`. \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "684ea33b",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function quadratic(a,b,c)\r\n    D = b^2 - 4*a*c\r\n    if D < 0\r\n        return \"There are no real roots\"\r\n    elseif D == 0\r\n        return -b/2a\r\n    else\r\n        return ((-b+sqrt(D))/2a, (-b-sqrt(D))/2a)\r\n    end    \r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8138babb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "该函数有三个可能的返回点，会根据判别式 `D` 的值返回三个不同表达式的值。最后一行中的 `return` 关键字可以省略，因为这是最后一个表达式。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6649d0d3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "96d270f4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Check that the `quadratic` function works by using it to solve the following three quadratic equations: \n* $$, \n* $$, \n* $x²+5x+7=0 xml-ph-0000@deepl.内部 x²-2x+1=0 xml-ph-0001@deepl.内部 x²+6x-16=0$.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
