    {
      "id": "b3b2ad51",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Named arguments\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "362f715f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "有些函数需要大量参数，或者具有大量行为选项。记住如何调用这类函数可能比较困难。**命名参数**可以让这些复杂接口更易于使用和扩展，因为参数可以通过名称而不仅仅通过位置来标识。\n\n例如，考虑用于绘制折线图的 `plot` 函数。该函数可能有许多参数，用于控制线型、粗细、颜色等。如果它接受命名参数，则一次可能的调用可以写成 `plot(x, y, width=2)`，其中我们只指定了线宽。这有两个作用：\n* 调用更易读，因为可以用参数名标明每个值的含义。\n* 可以按任意顺序传入大量参数中的任意子集。\n\n定义带命名参数的函数时，需要在参数列表中使用分号：\n```\nfunction plot(x, y; style=\"solid\", width=1, color=\"black\")\n    ###\nend\n```\n\n调用函数时，分号是可选的：可以调用 `plot(x, y, width=2)`，也可以调用 `plot(x, y; width=2)`，但第一种写法更常见。\n\n命名参数的默认值只在需要时（即未提供对应命名参数时）才会被计算，并且按从左到右的顺序计算。因此，默认表达式可以引用前面的命名参数。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1d4c7f57",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0dbe6a37",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Create a function `cost` that calculates the cost of a gold ingot in the shape of a rectangular parallelepiped. The function must be supplied with four named arguments: `length` (length, cm), `width` (width, cm), `height` (height, cm) and `price` (price, roubles per gram). Assume the density of gold to be $$. Then, by calling this function, calculate the value of a gold ingot measuring $19.32 \\text{ g/cm}^3 xml-ph-0000@deepl.内部 10 \\times 3 \\times 1$ cm and costing 6,200 roubles per gram.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "77a524f8",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "504a215c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 4,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6dadd070",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "As all the function’s arguments are named, the function description header will look like this (the list of named arguments follows the semicolon):\n\n```\nfunction cost(; length, width, height, price)\n```\n\nRemember that the volume of the ingot (cm$$) is calculated as the product of its length, width and height, whilst its mass (g) is calculated as the product of its volume (cm$$) and its density (g/cm$³ xml-ph-0000@deepl.内部 ³ xml-ph-0001@deepl.内部 ³$). The value is equal to the product of the mass (g) and the price (rubles/g). The resulting cost must be rounded up to the nearest integer (using the `ceil` function) and then converted to an integer type (using the `Int` function) to prevent the result being displayed in exponential form, which is not used for monetary amounts.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4f88777b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解决方案</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 2,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a5aa5f5d",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function cost(; length, width, height, price)\r\n    V = length * width * height\r\n    m = V * 19.32\r\n    return cost = Int(ceil(m * price))\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c98b3a11",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "cost(length=10, width=3, height=1, price=6200)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9782b303",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 数学函数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a949a8ea",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在 **Julia** 中，有大量标准数学函数。下面介绍最常用的一些。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "04656c35",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 绝对值和根\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a12b631a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `abs(x)` 是数 `x` 的绝对值。\n* `abs2(x)` 是数 `x` 的平方。\n* `sqrt(x)` 是 `x` 的平方根。\n* `cbrt(x)` 是 `x` 的立方根。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
