    {
      "id": "55edf35d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 幂和对数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f9a97dfa",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `exp(x)` 是 `e` 的 `x` 次幂。\n* `exp2(x)` 是 $2$ 的 `x` 次幂。\n* `exp10(x)` 是 $10$ 的 `x` 次幂。\n* `exponent(x)` 是满足 $2^y ≤ |x|$ 的最大整数 `y`。\n* `log(x)` 是 `x` 的自然对数。\n* `log2(x)` 是以 $2$ 为底的 `x` 的对数。\n* `log10(x)` 是 `x` 的常用对数。\n* `log(n,x)` 是以 `n` 为底的 `x` 的对数。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
