    {
      "id": "b729b9b7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 三角函数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0cfe3d70",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "If the argument `x` is given in radians, then \n\n* `sin(x)` is the sine of `x`.\n* `cos(x)` is the cosine of `x`.\n* `tan(x)` is the tangent of `x`.\n* `cot(x)` is the cotangent of `x`.\n* `asin(x)` is the arcsine of `x`.\n* `acos(x)` is the arccosine of `x`.\n* `atan(x)` is the arctangent of `x`.\n* `acot(x)` is the arccotangent of `x`.\n* `sinc(x)` is the cardinal sine of `x`: $`x` \\text{sinc}(x)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{\\sin(\\pi x)}{\\pi x} \\text{ 若 } x \\ne 0 \\\\ 1 \\text{ 若 } x=0 \\end{cases}$\n* `cosc(x)`是`x`的正弦的导数：$\\text{cosc}(x)=\\begin{cases} \\frac{\\cos(\\pi x)}{x} - \\frac{\\sin(\\pi x)}{\\pi x^2} \\text{ if } x \\ne 0 \\\\ 0 \\text{ if } x=0 \\end{cases}$\n\n若要用度（而非弧度）计算三角函数，请在函数名后添加后缀`d`：`sind(x)`、`cosd(x)`、`tand(x)`、`cotd(x)`、`asind(x)`、`acosd(x)`、`atand(x)`、`acotd(x)`。\n\n* `rad2deg(x)` – 将角度`x`从弧度转换为度。\n* `deg2rad(x)` – 将角度从度转换为弧度。\n\n示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
