    {
      "id": "d181af55",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 双曲函数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eb54a0ac",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `sinh(x)`是`x`的双曲正弦。\n* `cosh(x)`是`x`的双曲余弦。\n* `tanh(x)`是`x`的双曲正切。\n* `coth(x)`是`x`的双曲余切。\n\n相应的反双曲函数为：`asinh(x)`，`asoch(x)`，`atanh(x)`，`acoth(x)`。\n\n示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
