    {
      "id": "75418461",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n若需将数字四舍五入至`n`个小数位（而非整数），请将`digits=n`作为这四种函数中任意一种的第二个参数。 \n\n例如，让我们将数字`5.83659`四舍五入到小数点后位：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d6f461b8",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "round(5.83659, digits=2)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "074f1ff0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 除法函数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "faf0fae8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* `div(x,y)`是截断除法。商被四舍五入为“0”。\n* `fld(x,y)`是截断除法。商被舍入“为零”。\n* `cld(x,y)`是向下舍入的整数除法。商被舍入至负无穷大。\n* 是向上舍入的整数除法。商被舍入至正无穷大。\n* `rem(x,y)`是`x`除以`y`的整数除法余数；满足条件`x == div(x,y)*y + rem(x,y)`。其符号对应于`x`。\n* `mod(x,y)`是`x`除以`y`的整数除法余数；满足条件`x == fld(x,y)*y + mod(x,y)`。其符号对应于`y`。\n\n示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
