    {
      "id": "ad819433",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 特殊函数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cd7616b4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "[SpecialFunctions.jl](https://specialfunctions.juliamath.org/stable/) 包包含大量其他特殊的数学函数。其中包括伽玛函数、贝塔函数、积分正弦、积分余弦、误差函数、欧拉函数、贝塞尔函数、椭圆积分、黎曼ζ函数和其他函数。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e9400fa6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 变量范围\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b6161230",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "我们将**代码块**定义为包含在语法结构`function`或`let …​ end`之内的代码片段。在此类代码块中，您可以声明仅在该代码块内可见的局部变量，这些变量不会与代码其他部分的变量（例如全局变量）发生冲突。\n**作用域**决定了您可以在代码中的哪些位置使用一个变量。因此，变量可以是局部变量，也可以是全局变量。\n\n>**局部（内部）变量**是在其父元素（如函数、对象、代码块等）内部声明和定义的变量。局部变量仅在其定义的范围内可见，在该范围之外无法访问。\n\n示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "144c6e4c",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function func()\r\n    local_var = 10\r\n    println(local_var)\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e7c55312",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在此，`function func()`定义了一个名为`func`的函数，其局部范围内包含局部变量`local_var`。\n\n使用命令`func()`调用该函数将输出变量`local_var`的值，即$10$：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "82c86ccb",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "func()"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0aad6d91",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "函数执行完毕后，局部变量`local_var`便超出了范围，在函数外部无法访问。这意味着该变量仅存在于其被定义的代码块内。\n\n让我们尝试使用以下代码在局部范围之外访问变量`local_var`：\n\n```\nprintln(local_var)\n\nUndefVarError: `local_var` not defined\n```\n\n我们可以看到，外部代码无法访问该局部变量，并返回一条错误信息，指出局部变量`local_var`未定义。\n\n>**全局（外部）变量**是指在具有局部范围的函数和代码块之外定义的变量。全局变量可在代码的任何部分访问，且位于全局范围中。\n\n示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5587a011",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "global_var = 20\r\nfunction func()\r\n    println(global_var)\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "07ceb5c1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "这段代码声明了全局变量`global_var`，并定义了函数`func()`，该函数用于输出全局变量的值。使用`func()`命令调用该函数时，将输出全局变量`global_var`的值，即$20$：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5720e436",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "func()"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "59236c90",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "全局变量`global_var`可在函数外部使用：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
