            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ed336d61",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ">**变量遮蔽（**）是指在特定范围内（例如函数或代码块中），使用了一个与全局范围中变量同名的变量。结果，该范围内的变量会遮蔽（覆盖）外层范围中同名的变量。\n\n定义同名变量时请务必谨慎——由于变量遮蔽，范围内的变量可能与程序其他部分的同名变量具有不同的值或类型。\n\n例如，让我们看一段代码，其中定义了两个同名但值不同的变量：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f755ef2e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 10  # creating a global variable\r\n\r\nfunction func()\r\n    x = 20  # creating a local variable (within a function) with the same name as a global variable\r\n    println(x)  # a local variable will be used within the function\r\nend\r\n\r\nfunc()  # function call\r\nprintln(x)  # the global variable was not modified within the function, so its value is printed"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3c11d560",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在函数内部创建了一个与全局变量同名（`x`）的局部变量。这不会改变全局变量，而是创建了一个仅在函数内部可见的新局部变量。因此，两者变量的值将分别被打印出来：`20` （全局）和`10` （局部）。因此，在不同的范围中声明变量有助于避免因同名变量被覆盖而产生的问题。\n\n> 变量的范围可以通过以下两个关键字之一显式指定：`global`或`local`。\n\n例如，让我们定义一个函数`func`，其中置位了变量`x`的值。为了使该变量在函数外部可用，我们通过在变量名前添加关键字`global`将其设为全局变量。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ead0c233",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function func()\r\n    global x = 30\r\nend  "
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1a934de9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "调用函数`func()`将输出该变量的值，即$30$。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
