          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cff94fb5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "变量`x`被定义为全局变量，因此可以在函数外部访问它：\n\n"
      ],
