    {
      "id": "dd9903bf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "由于变量`x`必须在`func`函数内部可见，因此`x`必须声明为全局变量（`global x`）。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
