    {
      "id": "519659b0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n`let`语句创建了一个具有严格范围的**代码块**。这意味着，如果局部变量`y`尚未存在，且赋值操作发生在形成严格范围的结构内（即在由`let`和`end`语句界定的代码块内），则会在赋值的作用域内创建一个名为`y`的新局部变量。\n\n让我们来看一个例子：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6fd2386c",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "let y = 1\r\n    let y = 2\r\n    end\r\n    y\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "de662a5a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在此，在外层`let`代码块中，创建了一个名为`y`的局部变量，其值为`1`。在嵌套（内层）的`let`代码块中，创建了一个独立的局部变量`y`，其值为`2`。从外层代码块调用变量`y`时，将输出该代码块中为其赋的值，即`1`。如果你尝试在外层`let`代码块之外访问变量`y`，将会引发错误，因为变量`y`是局部变量。\n\n你可以使用不带参数的`let`语句，仅用于引入一个新的范围，而不会立即创建任何新的绑定。\n\n以下代码与前面的代码完全等价：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ece450e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "let\r\n    local y = 1\r\n    let\r\n        local y = 2\r\n    end\r\n    y\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
